HOUT2  LGL 6                         INTO                               FIOP0353
       TNO HOUT4                     THE                                FIOP0354
HOUT3  SLW ..                        OUTPUT                             FIOP0355
       CAL *-1                       BUFFER.                            FIOP0356
       ADD L(1)                      ..                                 FIOP0357
